<title>USA: AM International Inc FY 1996 July 31 loss.</title>
<headline>AM International Inc FY 1996 July 31 loss.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNT PROSPECT, Ill. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $6.49   profit	 $0.66</p>
<p> Net	loss	   45,500   profit	 4,600</p>
<p> Revs		     168,100		  191,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal 1996 results include $25.3 million of losses from the company's discontinued operations and a $7 million restructuring charge related to the Canadian bankruptcy and the shutdown of operations and other restructuring activities.</p>
<p>Fourth quarter 1996 earnings were not available.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
